# Title: Inclusion to Exclude: How Femonationalism Impacts Policy Preferences
# Author: Sophie Mainz
# File: readme.txt 

This dataset contains the following files: 


Data file: 
"data.csv" is a comma-separated file containing the full data of N=3118 respondents.

Codebook: 
"coodebook.pdf" contains an overview and descriptions of all variables used in the analysis.

R script files: 
a. "analysis.R" contains R code to replicate the analysis, including all figures in the main aritcle
b. "supporting_information.R" contains R code to replicate the tables and figures in the Appendix. 


R project: 
"femnat-replication_files.Rproj" allows opening the whole project in a self-contained R session, in R Studio.


Folder: 
"figures" is folder in which all figures that are generated by running either analysis.R or supporting_information.R will be stored. 

Logs: 
"log_main.txt" is the output log from running "analysis.R"
"log_appendix.txt" is the output log from running "supporting_information.R"
